# 📍 Movie Locations

*Train to Busan* is set primarily in **South Korea**.

### 🚆 Main Locations in the Story

* 🇰🇷 **Seoul** — The journey begins when Seok-woo and Su-an board the train.
* 🚆 **KTX Train** — Most of the movie takes place inside the high-speed train traveling toward Busan.
* 🏙️ **Daejeon** — The train passes through the city during the journey.
* 🌊 **Busan** — The passengers' destination and the final major location of the story.
* 🚉 **Train Stations & Railway Tracks** — Several important survival scenes take place around stations and railway areas.

### 🎬 Setting

The confined environment of the train is an important part of the movie. The narrow coaches and limited escape routes create tension as the passengers try to survive the zombie outbreak.
